														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1520770">
									

<p>I really like this. Especially some of the test logs, and especially the kicker: once you finish (or fail at) the game, you may still continue to live your life, but it will never be the same again. Navigating ANY building will require help and a lot of trial and error, and you could conceivably end up trapped for a long time depending on how high the chance is that the door will keep opening to the game. And living outside forever&#8230; kind shitty, eh? Your life would be forever altered. And maybe, just maybe, eventually you're going to figure 'fuck it, let me bite the bullet and enter the room' and then &#8230; who knows what's on the other side? Gah.</p>
<p>+1</p>

