<p>2. I don't care for the ending much. There's no particular reason why the Foundation would react with &quot;Whoop, sorry, you gotta go be molested again!&quot; when they could just, um, not do that. They don't gain anything from it or lose anything by just letting her go into the door or kill herself on her own schedule.</p>
